## System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    User --> CLI[CLI: run.py]
    CLI --> Orchestrator

    Orchestrator --> Guardrails
    Orchestrator --> Reasoning[Reasoning Engine]
    Reasoning --> Retriever
    Retriever --> Qdrant[(Qdrant)]
    Reasoning --> LLMRouter
    LLMRouter --> Providers[Provider Clients]
    Reasoning --> Evaluator

    Evaluator -->|pass/fail signal| Reasoning
    Reasoning -->|final validated response| Orchestrator
    Orchestrator --> CLI

    CLI --> User

    OpenWebUI --> API[REST/OpenAI-compatible API]
    API --> Orchestrator
```
